      ],
      "source": "https://beckdc.com/historical-places-in-monroe-north/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Pink Castle, built in the early 1900s, is one of Monroe North’s most colorful historic landmarks.",
